  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 509.01 Small and Large Quantity Generator Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 509.01 Small and Large Quantity Generator Requirements.\n\n(a) A small or large quantity generator shall comply with the following independent requirements:\n\n(1) Env-Hw 502 through Env-Hw 505;\n\n(2) Env-Hw 507.02;\n\n(3) Env-Hw 507.03;\n\n(4) Env-Hw 509.04;\n\n(5) Env-Hw 510 through Env-Hw 512; and\n\n(6) Env-Hw 515.\n\n(b) A small or large quantity generator shall be subject to the applicable requirements of Env-Hw 300, Env-Hw 700, Env-Hw 800, Env-Hw 1200, and Env-Hw 1300, unless it meets the conditions for exemption in Env-Hw 509.02, Env-Hw 509.03, and Env-Hw 513, as applicable.\n\nSource. #5053, eff 1-24-91; ss by #5886, eff 8-26-94; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; ss by #10494, eff 1-1-14; ss by #12347, eff 8-14-17; ss by #14280, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35",
